<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 126,910.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 126,910.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 11 totaled 126,910 bales, down from 127,421 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, no decertification orders, and 511 cancellations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
